{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ConditionalCorollaries","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConditionalCorollaries","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ConditionalClasses"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.hv_bp_full_composition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.hv_bp_full_composition","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConditionalCorollaries.lean#L60-L70","doc":"**Full hyperbolic-volume + baryon-period composition**: under\nboth classes, the geometric universality holds at every q > 1,\nevery positive volume, and the lower-bound witness holds. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.unitary_pairing_scaled","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.unitary_pairing_scaled","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConditionalCorollaries.lean#L49-L58","doc":"**Volume-positivity preservation**: the pairing-unitary form\nrequires `vol > 0`, which is preserved under multiplication\nby any positive scalar. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.unitary_pairing_with_pl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.unitary_pairing_with_pl","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConditionalCorollaries.lean#L38-L47","doc":"**Two-class composition**: under both\n`[SingleVolumeIrrational]` and `[PLCorrectnessHypotheses]`,\nthe unitary pairing identity continues to hold for arbitrary\npositive volumes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.pl_decomposition_lower_bound_invoked","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.pl_decomposition_lower_bound_invoked","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConditionalCorollaries.lean#L31-L36","doc":"**Picard-Lefschetz lower bound (conditional)** — direct\ninvocation of the `[PLCorrectnessHypotheses]` class field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.singleVolume_pairing_unitary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.singleVolume_pairing_unitary","kind":"theorem","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConditionalCorollaries.lean#L22-L29","doc":"**Frobenius self-pairing unitarity (conditional)** — direct\ninvocation of the `[SingleVolumeIrrational]` class field. ","signatureChunk":0}]}